  "description": "Yoon is a free agent, using his extraordinary strength and cunning for any job that comes his way—legal or otherwise. But when a crucial mistake plunges him headfirst into the world of a shadowy crime network known only as the “platform,” he enlists the help of a well-connected alpha named Kwon Shin-Woo. Together, these reluctant allies will have to uncover the mysteries of the nefarious platform… and each other..\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
